n\nWill you extricate your realm from the malevolent forces that possess it? Or will you rejoin the ranks of the fallen?\n\nThis is a demo that features one level from the paid early access version that is available now on App Lab.", "short_description": "VR meets old school FPS. Blast your way through an ancient temple that has been overrun by undead minions. Combines the best elements of VR and classic shooters.  This is a demo that features one level from the paid early access version that is available now on App Lab."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://realmofthefallen.com/rotf-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Destructor LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://realmofthefallen.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "803804588027625"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031538_152838681127631_2325809952054735562_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zpun0UH6s4AQ7kNvwFGS4WE&_nc_oc=AdmcF8xhT4Hz7aRGh1kQBpK0wF6kfIehLTysV_stp3IVdmbQskp85HLIZkqeJA-yXjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzDstYwGxKrJq3RB1DOVAHOnanLG2JYBgMhddMBfvFyiA&oe=69AC335A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Realm of the Fallen: Demo", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_c